  "description": "Andrew, a servant working for an Irish noble family, meets a guest at his mansion, Nora Greenwood. He makes a bet with his friends to see if he, a womanizer, can seduce her, who is known for being introverted. However, Nora, who appears to be a shy woman, is completely different from what Andrew expected...\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Sunaemul Danpyeonseon (순애물 단편선) Collection.*",
